					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-000068</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. TLS 1.2 floor with an explicit AEAD, forward-secret cipher list and sniStrict, stated in the ingress rather than left to the library default.

Evidence: traefik/dynamic-sso/dynamic.yml (tls.options.default)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — a default client negotiates TLSv1.3 with an AEAD suite; TLS 1.1 is refused at the handshake</FINDING_DETAILS>
				<COMMENTS>Determination: Mitigated. Tracked in artifacts/srg_status.yml; regenerate with gen_srg_tracker.py.</COMMENTS>
