				<STATUS>Open</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>PLANNED — feasible on the current architecture.

Aggregated into a PRIVATE MinIO bucket (ir-logs), held apart from evidence and carved regions and reachable only through the mesh. Object storage is the 'different system or media' the control asks for without adding an egress path or a second product to run: the store already exists, is already backed up as a unit, and already has a retention lifecycle the platform understands. An external monitor reads the bucket rather than being given a route to the ingress.

Where: deploy/enclave/docker-compose.yml (log-shipper), backend/cases/storage.py (ir-logs bucket), backend/cases/componenthealth.py</FINDING_DETAILS>
