				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Every request passes the SSO gate; Keycloak group membership maps to a platform role, and the API enforces per-role permissions. The backend trusts forwarded identity only when the proxy shared secret matches, so headers cannot be spoofed by a direct client.

