					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Review the web server documentation and deployed configuration to determine if the web server contains sufficient information to establish what type of event occurred. Request a user access the hosted applications, and verify sufficient information is recorded. If sufficient information is not logged, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
