					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Review the web server documentation and deployment configuration to determine if the web server is configured to generate the outcome (success or failure) of the event. Request a user access the hosted application and generate logable events, and then review the logs to determine if the outcome of the event can be established. If the outcome of the event cannot be determined, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the web server to generate the outcome, success or failure, as part of each logable event.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
