					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Review the web server documentation and deployed configuration to determine if web server features, services, and processes are installed that are not needed for hosted application deployment. If excessive features, services, and processes are installed, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
