				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. nginx serves static content for one origin and proxies nothing outbound. Traefik is a REVERSE proxy for that single origin — the approved architecture — and the enclave has no egress for a forward proxy to use.

Evidence: frontend/nginx.conf.template, traefik/dynamic-sso/dynamic.yml

Verified by: test/uat_dns.sh — no service resolves an outside name</FINDING_DETAILS>
