				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Utility programs and unrelated services are absent from the images by construction — there is no installer offering them.

Evidence: frontend/Dockerfile, backend/Dockerfile

Not yet verified by a test — determination rests on inspection.</FINDING_DETAILS>
