				</STIG_DATA>
				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Served types are enumerated rather than inherited from the stock mime.types, and the default type is application/octet-stream, so an unknown extension downloads instead of being interpreted.

Evidence: frontend/nginx.conf.template (types block, default_type)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the explicit default type is asserted</FINDING_DETAILS>
