					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Review the web server documentation and deployment configuration to determine whether the web server is configured to listen on a specified IP address and port. Request a client user try to access the web server on any other available IP addresses on the hosting hardware. If an IP address is not configured on the web server or a client can reach the web server on other IP addresses assigned to the hosting hardware, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
