				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Private keys are readable only by the component that serves them. The DMZ holds the Boundary controller's certificate and NOT its key, which is asserted rather than assumed.

Evidence: deploy/dmz/docker-compose.yml mounts boundary.crt only

Verified by: test/uat_boundary.sh — the controller's private key is not readable in the DMZ</FINDING_DETAILS>
				<COMMENTS>Determination: Mitigated. Tracked in artifacts/srg_status.yml; regenerate with gen_srg_tracker.py.</COMMENTS>
