				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. A Content-Security-Policy constrains the React bundle to its own origin — default-src 'self', object-src 'none', frame-ancestors 'none' — applied to the application only, so the identity provider keeps the policy its login form needs.

Evidence: traefik/dynamic-sso/dynamic.yml (app-csp middleware)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the policy is present, defaults to 'self', and refuses framing; the IdP still serves its login endpoints</FINDING_DETAILS>
