				<STATUS>Open</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>PLANNED — requires an architectural or web-tier redesign.

Data at rest is not encrypted: MinIO stores captures unencrypted and Postgres has no transparent encryption. This is the largest remaining gap for a platform holding memory images — it needs MinIO server-side encryption with a Vault-held key, plus an encrypted volume or pgcrypto decision for the metadata store.

Where: deploy/enclave/docker-compose.yml (MinIO KMS), hashicorp/vault/</FINDING_DETAILS>
