				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The ingress strips Server and X-Powered-By on the way out (an empty value removes the header) and nginx sets server_tokens off, so an error served before the ingress sees it does not name the server either.

Evidence: traefik/dynamic-sso/dynamic.yml (sec-headers), frontend/nginx.conf.template

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — no Server or X-Powered-By header; HSTS, nosniff, frame-deny and referrer-policy present</FINDING_DETAILS>
				<COMMENTS>Determination: Mitigated. Tracked in artifacts/srg_status.yml; regenerate with gen_srg_tracker.py.</COMMENTS>
