				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. An eight-hour absolute session lifetime, stated in both halves: the gate's cookie expiry and the realm's ssoSessionMaxLifespan. The shorter wins, and setting only one leaves the other's default in force.

Evidence: deploy/enclave/docker-compose.yml (--cookie-expire=8h), hashicorp/keycloak/realm- irplatform.json (ssoSessionMaxLifespan)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the gate reports expiry:8h0m0s at startup, which is the deployed value</FINDING_DETAILS>
				<COMMENTS>Determination: Mitigated. Tracked in artifacts/srg_status.yml; regenerate with gen_srg_tracker.py.</COMMENTS>
