				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The session is re-validated against the identity provider every fifteen minutes, which is what makes an idle session lapse and a revoked account stop working mid-session, paired with the realm's ssoSessionIdleTimeout.

Evidence: deploy/enclave/docker-compose.yml (--cookie-refresh=15m), hashicorp/keycloak/realm- irplatform.json (ssoSessionIdleTimeout)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the gate reports refresh:after 15m0s</FINDING_DETAILS>
