					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Review the web server configuration to verify that the web server is restricting access from nonsecure zones. If the web server is not configured to restrict access from nonsecure zones, then this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
