				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The web tier holds no container runtime access, so no process it runs can stop the server; stopping is an operator action on the host, or a named repair request the isolated agent executes.

Evidence: SECURITY-MODEL.md P10; troubleshooting/remediation-agent.sh

Verified by: test/uat_repairs.sh — unknown actions and non-admin principals are refused</FINDING_DETAILS>
