				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Tuning is derived from the hardware each container actually has rather than fixed: Postgres settings come from pg-tune.sh, and the worker's concurrency and memory limits are declared.

