				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. TLS on the ingress, Boundary per-session mutual TLS on the approach, Connect mutual TLS between enclave services. No hop in the analyst path is cleartext.

Evidence: SECURITY-MODEL.md P4 and P9

