				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The session cookie is not compressed, and cannot be: the gate offers no cookie compression option, and with the Redis session store the cookie carries a REFERENCE rather than session content — there is nothing in it whose compressed length could leak.

Evidence: deploy/enclave/docker-compose.yml (--session-store-type=redis); oauth2-proxy exposes no cookie-compression flag

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the server-side session store is asserted, which is what makes the cookie a ticket</FINDING_DETAILS>
