					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the web server is configured to maintain a list of commonly used, expected, or compromised passwords on an organization-defined frequency. If the web server is not configured to maintain a list of commonly used, expected, or compromised passwords on an organization-defined frequency, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the web server to maintain a list of commonly used, expected, or compromised passwords on an organization-defined frequency.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
