					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-004058</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS>
				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The realm enforces a password policy: length 15, all four character classes, notUsername and notEmail, history 5, forced change on expiry. Read from the RUNNING realm, because an import never overwrites an existing one — deploy.sh recreates Keycloak when the realm file changes so the two cannot disagree. notUsername and notEmail refuse the two guesses made first.

Evidence: hashicorp/keycloak/realm-irplatform.json (passwordPolicy)

Verified by: test/uat_srg_webtier.sh — the policy is read back from the running realm and each element asserted</FINDING_DETAILS>
