				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. The realm enforces a password policy: length 15, all four character classes, notUsername and notEmail, history 5, forced change on expiry. Read from the RUNNING realm, because an import never overwrites an existing one — deploy.sh recreates Keycloak when the realm file changes so the two cannot disagree. Verification happens on every set, since the policy is the realm's.

