					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the web server is configured to implement a local cache of revocation data to support path discovery and validation. If the web server is not configured to implement a local cache of revocation data to support path discovery and validation, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
				<STIG_DATA>
					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
