				<FINDING_DETAILS>MITIGATED. Trust is pinned, not inherited: each client trusts exactly the CA it must. tailscaled's SSL_CERT_FILE REPLACES the system trust pool with the control-plane certificate, and Boundary clients pin BOUNDARY_CACERT.

